    <questiondescription format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p id="author">Ben (STACK author)</p>
<p id="concept">Mean of ungrouped data by the simple formula (Sum x)/n; total then mean.</p>
<p id="reviewer"></p>
<p id="description">Students find the total of a small raw dataset then the mean. Data is built backwards from a chosen integer mean so the answer is exact. Diagnostics catch giving the total without dividing, and giving the median.</p>]]></text>
